-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights are distributed in this repository. On first run Mimic
downloads:

    Audio8/Audio8-TTS-Preview-0.6B-ONNX-INT4

from Hugging Face, published under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Note that the PyTorch base models in the same family (Audio8-TTS-Preview-0.1b
and -0.6b) are released under the Audio8 Community License, which is a
different and more restrictive licence. Mimic uses the ONNX release only.

On request — never automatically — the iPhone app also downloads:

    onnx-community/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct

an ONNX export of Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct by Alibaba Cloud, published under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. It is used to write text for the speech model to
read, and only when somebody asks for it.

    Qwen2.5 Technical Report, Qwen Team, Alibaba Group, 2024
    https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct
